{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/780458-loom-and-reality-glitches-sidereal-s-everyday-life-problems","id":780458,"title":"Loom and \"Reality\" glitches, Sidereal's everyday life problems.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Sidereal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-05T02:33:55-08:00","id":780458,"title":"Loom and \"Reality\" glitches, Sidereal's everyday life problems.","content":"OK I know one of Sidereal's jobs is to maintain the Loom of Fate and make sure the things that will happen will basically happen. Assuming 2e lore, Essence users can disrupt the Loom of fate and cause threads to be tangled while beings outside of Fate (EX: Demons, Fey) can cause merry hell on the Loom itself. This I get, I get the causes of how the Loom can basically bug out.<br /> <br /> But my question is the effect, <i>what effect does this have in the world?</i> What are some good &quot;reality hiccups&quot; that can be show in an area which has the Loom of fate tangled up in an area. I mean there has to be something between &quot;Reality + causality is in full force here&quot; and &quot;Everything unraveled into Deep Wyld.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Read my shit at my <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/271207-sandact6-homebrew-topic\" target=\"_blank\">homebrew</a> topic, 2.5e and 3e material!<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1263020-alchemicals-2-0-3e-conversion-charm-design-request\" target=\"_blank\">Play Alchemical's in 3e now</a>, you're welcome.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1183-sandact6","name":"Sandact6","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1183_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-05T03:20:11-08:00","id":780472,"title":"","content":"The heir to the throne is assassinated. To everyone, she is dead : a magnificent burial is organised, and the kingdom lives on. Soon, the vizier uses the void to proclaim himself heir, as he planned to do all along. But the heir survived : she is in the palace, every day, trying to get people to react to her. Every single person who would be able to recognise her forgets that she is alive as soon as they take their eyes off her. Every minute is a struggle, as not matter how long she spends explaining what is happening to her family, servants or rivals, they forget all about it as soon as they leave the room.<br /> <br /> A man wakes up in the body of his mule. He is beaten, and forced to work in his own farm. The one who took his place is simple of mind, loves to torment him, and seems to love carrots.<br /> <br /> After a drinking binge, a man comes home, to find another version of him living in his house. The other him never went drinking.<br /> <br /> Etc... etc..","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-05T03:35:53-08:00","id":780479,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LeTipex</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/780458-loom-and-reality-glitches-sidereal-s-everyday-life-problems?p=780472#post780472\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The heir to the throne is assassinated. To everyone, she is dead : a magnificent burial is organised, and the kingdom lives on. Soon, the vizier uses the void to proclaim himself heir, as he planned to do all along. But the heir survived : she is in the palace, every day, trying to get people to react to her. Every single person who would be able to recognise her forgets that she is alive as soon as they take their eyes off her. Every minute is a struggle, as not matter how long she spends explaining what is happening to her family, servants or rivals, they forget all about it as soon as they leave the room.</div> </div> </div> </div>Diskworld fan? Because I feel strongly reminded of the book <a href=\"http://wiki.lspace.org/mediawiki/Book:Mort\" target=\"_blank\">Mort</a>, and what happened to <a href=\"http://wiki.lspace.org/mediawiki/Keli\" target=\"_blank\">Keli</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Silencing Whisper, <i>Eclipse</i>; Amethyst, <i>Changing Moon</i>;<br /> Daughter of Charcoal and Ash, <i>Dusk</i>, and her <i>Full Moon </i>sister;<br /> Broken Crystal, <i>Infernal </i>(<i>Night</i>-, or maybe <i>Twilight</i>-equivalent).","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7262-amakawa-yuuto"